=== PARITY (vs web RedisDiagnosticEmptyState.tsx) ===
  Data sources -> bound via the shared state-holder seam (RedisDiagnosticSource -> RedisDiagnosticModel):
    useTranslation (P1/S10 RDStrings), useDateFormat (RedisDiagnosticFormat), useQuery(['redis-signal-keys'])
    (RedisDiagnosticKeysState). The production source composes the parent's redis-signals query snapshot
    (meta / serverError / networkError / vehicleId) with the keys query; the view performs NO HTTP.
  Projection -> RedisDiagnosticProjection.resolve is a 1:1 port of the web if-ladder, error branches first:
    0.A cacheNotWired (503 & /not available/i, danger, CTA /docs/caching#configuration) ·
    0.B unreachable (502/503/504 & /unreachable|upstream/i, danger) ·
    0.C requestFailed (any other ApiError, warning, body {{status}} {{message}}) ·
    0.D networkError (warning) · then no-meta legacy EmptyState · then
    1 modeLocal (mode==local, danger, CTA /docs/caching) ·
    2 mirrorBroken (l1>0 && l2==0, warning, body {{count}}, otherKeys) ·
    3 noTelemetry (l1==0 && (l1LastSeen==nil || now-l1LastSeen>7d), info, bodyStale{{date}}/bodyAbsent, otherKeys) ·
    4 fallthrough (neutral, otherKeys). Error branches always win over meta (verified by EXECUTED XCTest).
  otherKeys -> keysFailed/idle/loading ? [] : keys.filter(id != self && field_count>0); chips capped at 6;
    tap -> onSelectVehicle. The meta list (mode badge + key + l1/l2 counts + l1/l2 last-seen + VIN?) renders
    in EVERY banner branch when meta is present (web `{meta && <DiagnosticMetaList/>}`).
  Composition -> toned bordered banner (web GlassPanel `border-{tone}-500/30 bg-{tone}-500/5`): leading
    SF Symbol (ServerCrash->externaldrive.badge.xmark, AlertTriangle->exclamationmark.triangle.fill,
    Zap->bolt.fill, Radio->dot.radiowaves.left.and.right, Database->externaldrive) in text-secondary
    (tone-invariant, web parity), title (text-primary), body (text-secondary), meta Grid, retry, docs Link,
    other-vehicle chips. The no-meta fallback renders ContentUnavailableView (web EmptyState).
  Shared components -> @/components/ui (GlassPanel/Badge/Button) + @/components/feedback (EmptyState) map to
